	<!-- Attachments of the day notes (P2): the camera of the system takes the
	     photo and the photo library gives the one that is already there. The
	     app never reads the library on its own: it only asks for the picture
	     the person chooses. -->
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Para hacer una foto y añadirla a la nota de un día de tu cuadrante.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
